@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@
+# Aegis artifact-init image
+
+Purpose:
+- Used as a Kubernetes initContainer image for Aegis model deployments
+- Contains `boto3` + `requests` so we never `pip install` at runtime
+
+Build:
+```bash
+docker build -t <registry>/aegis-artifact-init:<tag> ops/images/artifact-init
+docker push <registry>/aegis-artifact-init:<tag>
+```
+
+Configure Aegis API:
+```bash
+export AEGIS_ARTIFACT_INIT_IMAGE=<registry>/aegis-artifact-init:<tag>
+```
